  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning application ref: 2021/00933/FUL granted under appeal ref: APP/H5390/W/22/3290703 dated 5th April 2023 for the 'Demolition of the existing building and erection of a part-three, part-four storey building to provide Class E (a) (b) (c) at ground floor level with 16 no. self-contained flats at ground, first, second, and third floor levels with associated rooftop plant.' Amendments to the approved drawings to include: Front Elevation: Change to point of entry to Flat 1 to be located to the front and not internal, alterations to commercial ground floor glazing pattern to add in fire break, change to reduce window cill, slight change to 3no windows setting out to three-storey element; Rear Elevation: Change to rear fenestration pattern; Residential communal Area: Changes to entry spaces to provide ventilated lobbies, change to stairwell to provide clear lift space, change to rear & bin lobbies to meet turning of bins & bicycles to provide a 'protected lobby', change to post boxes, change to bike store to provide clear zones, new electrical risers and smoke vents, and enlarged lift and stair lobbies; Commercial unit: Change to commercial unit to address residential circulation space; Residential flats: Change to entry of Flat, enlarged lift, updates to flats layouts, and roof plant updated to accord with details for condition 6.",
